&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "A sudden pause in your vision, the actor that you are in control trembles

CUE / PHONE: CUE CARD: — Don't underestimate me mother.

You heard a voicce coming out from your phone.

THE MAIN ACTOR:
\"Don't underestimate me mother..\"",
"offset": Vector2(1900, 37000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_23",
"text": "Watch the show."
}
},
"size": Vector2(480.00012, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_10": {
"dialogue": "STAGE MANAGER:  
\"My pleasure.\"

The man quickly get off the stage.",
"offset": Vector2(10650, 1700),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_13",
"text": "Begin the show"
}
},
"size": Vector2(480.00024, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_11": {
"dialogue": "STAGE: Two characters enter the stage. The older woman confidently walk. 

The back of a second character can be seen, slowly walk from behind the stage up.

The two characters start in their position
ACTOR 1:  
\"My dear, you're almost eighteen.\"

\"Your birthday is coming in 1 month. you'll stand before everyone and declare the path you roles.\"

She smiles.

\"Have you decided what you want to become?\"

Then she stops.

She looks directly at you.

She is waiting for your line.

[what would you say]",
"offset": Vector2(2160, 10020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_15",
"text": "Mention her dream."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_12",
"text": "Say something off-topic."
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_14",
"text": "Remain silent."
}
},
"size": Vector2(479.99945, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_12": {
"dialogue": "You attempt an unrelated response.

Mother's smile remains frozen for a moment.

She quietly signal you as you are trying to make out her words.

ACTOR 1::  
\"...Hey. I know you love joking but this isn't funny. We are in front of the crowd\"

She lowers her voice.

\"Say it again.\"",
"offset": Vector2(5160, 9360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Try another response."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Say nothing."
}
},
"size": Vector2(480.0005, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_13": {
"dialogue": "SOUND: tranditional music heard in theater kicks in.

The voice of the grumpy stagae manager can be heard again from the left side of the stage.


STAGE MANAGER: \"Once upon a time, there is a lovely family in the town.
There, they just bore a new little princess.

She grows up with brilliant beauty, with a majestic voice, blonde hair, and a marvelous, gentle personality.
A month before their daughters turn eighteen, her mother was having tea in the garden, looking at her.\"",
"offset": Vector2(650, 10100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_11",
"text": "Next Scene."
}
},
"size": Vector2(480, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_14": {
"dialogue": "The silence lasts too long.

Mother glances toward the side of the stage.

Then back at you.

MOTHER:  
\"Hey\"

\"Your linesss. The scriptttttt!!!\"",
"offset": Vector2(3980, 11240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Try to say something."
}
},
"size": Vector2(480.00055, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_15": {
"dialogue": "You attempt a response.

Mother's smile remains frozen for a moment.

She quietly signal you as you are trying to make out her words.

MOTHER:  
\"...pss hey. That isn't suppose to be your line.\"

She lowers her voice.

\"Say it again.\"",
"offset": Vector2(3500, 9260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Try another response."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Say nothing."
}
},
"size": Vector2(480.00067, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_16": {
"dialogue": "You try again.

Nothing you say feels right.

The actor stares at you.

Her expression changes.

For just a moment, she stops acting.

ACTOR 1, quietly:  
\"... You actually forgot your script. Guess we have to turn to plan B.\"

Her hands giving signals to the crew.

Something moves beyond the edge of the stage.

A card rises into view on your left.




CUE / PHONE: CUE CARD: — I WANT TO BECOME A WRITER, JUST LIKE YOU.

ACTOR 1:  
\"Look on your side. See anything?\"",
"offset": Vector2(6680, 10760),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_17",
"text": "Read the cue card aloud."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_18",
"text": "Continue saying something else."
}
},
"size": Vector2(479.99756, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_17": {
"dialogue": "YOU:  
You notice a white board with hand written sentence that says:
\"I want to become a writer, just like you.\"

As you read your lines out while trying to perform, your acting mate continues.

MOTHER:  
\"A writer?\"

\"And what sort of writer will you be?\"

CUE / PHONE: CUE CARD: — I WANT TO CREATE STORIES PEOPLE CAN GATHER AROUND AND REMEMBER.",
