&"1_21": {
"dialogue": "YOU:  
You read your lines out again
\"I want to create stories people can gather around and remember.\"

MOTHER:  
\"A lovely ambition.\"

\"That's lovely, dear, but I hope you won't get overwhelmed by the sheer pain in your fingers and getting calluses, writing so much with you.\"

CUE / PHONE: CUE CARD: — Don't underestimate me mother.",
"offset": Vector2(13200, 11400),
"options": {
