&"1_23": {
"dialogue": "YOU:  
\"I'll be fine.\"

\"By the time, I will make more happy people reading my books than caring about the little bumps, pain in my finger.\"

Mother smiles.

MOTHER:  

\"Great. Now go on.

We should have a lot of work to do before your birthday comes.

Me and father are gonna organize a big party.

We're gonna invite people all around the kingdom to visit, to attend your own birthday.\"

Preparations begin throughout the kingdom.
The princess's eighteenth birthday is approaching.
In this world, reaching eighteen is not only a birthday.
