&"1_24": {
"dialogue": "Before you can start the game, on the second screen, you see a spark of light cast on a thin long lines. It runs through quickly before disappear. It happens almost immediate. 

And then the Stage manager standing from the other side (on your computer), elegantly walk out, still with his despise look on you.



**Listen. Find the cue. Speak.**

NARRATOR
\"One month passes.
The day of the celebration finally arrives.
People from around the kingdom gather for the princess's birthday and declaration.\"

STAGE:
The curtain once again unveil
The stage changes from the family home into the preparation for the princess's eighteenth birthday.


The hall is crowded.
Musicians prepare.
Servants and performers move around the stage.
The princess is preparing to appear before everyone.

Both of the actors, including the one you are controlling, walks out.

Actor 1 approaches you from the side, gently nudge the MC elbow.

MOTHER:  

\"Look at that, child.
Today is the day.
I can not believe it.
You're gonna be a true adult.\"


The MC girl, ironically look confused, she keeps staring at the actor. But not for long becase the cue has again appear on the other side.


