&"1_6": {
"dialogue": "He take a moment glancing, before make a grumpy voice at you...
STAGE MANAGER:
\"...Excusez moi What the mother?\"

He quickly fix his posture before calmly asking again

STAGE MANAGER: \"Fine. We can wait.\"

A pause.

STAGE MANAGER: \"But the show is waiting for you. Ready anytime....
NOW?....\"",
"offset": Vector2(3150, 5950),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_9",
"text": "Yes."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_7",
"text": "Not yet."
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_8",
"text": "Say Something else unrelated"
}
},
"size": Vector2(480.00067, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_7": {
"dialogue": "The manager waits awkwardly.

STAGE: The man keep making a disappointed face
SOUND: the ambience is now mixed with off beat melodies.
STAGE MANAGER:  
\"I.... We really do need to begin the show Now. Drop the act now.\"",
"offset": Vector2(5650, 5100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_9",
"text": "Yes"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_5",
"text": "Continue say something else"
}
},
"size": Vector2(479.99927, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_8": {
"dialogue": "STAGE: The man lookes at you with an annoyed look.
He make a baffled noise.


SOUND: The ambience music stops for 3 seconds, before start playing again

STAGE MANAGER: \"Let's be serious here. This is not a joke, we should get going in any time now.
I'm asking you again. 
Shall we kicks off the show?\"",
"offset": Vector2(4400, 850),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_7",
"text": "No."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_10",
"text": "Yes."
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_3",
"text": "Continue saying something else."
}
},
"size": Vector2(479.99994, 600),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_9": {
"dialogue": "STAGE MANAGER:  
\"Good. Please don't do that again and be serious\" with a loud sigh.

The man quickly get off the stage, His eys still gazed downward to you.",
"offset": Vector2(8150, 3400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_13",
"text": "Begin the show"
}
},
"size": Vector2(480.00122, 600),
"speaker": ""
